Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:31:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1054/1178] Post: progress you can see

1060: every job in the tree has a bar, and while Forge works on the take in
hand a card floats in Post: what runs, for how long, about how much is left.
The lab says running or queued, not how far: the estimate comes from rates
measured on Forge (seconds of work per second of audio) and stops at 95 %
until the file lands. A tick updates only the bars, never the tree, so its
players do not start over.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
